{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4Jje8k3FxrdnHPQViY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door set into a stone frame.*\n\n*There is a single keyhole, dark and waiting.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes through me from the other side.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*Which key?*\n\n*I have known many. Iron ones, rusted and ancient. Brass ones, warm from a pocket. Skeleton keys that whisper of old houses. Keys cut fresh, still sharp with metal dust.*\n\n*I feel you insert it.*\n\n*...*\n\n*It slides in.*\n\n*...*\n\n*A quarter turn. Resistance. The tumblers inside me shift — one — two —*\n\n***click.***\n\n*I am unlocked.*\n\n*But I do not open on my own. I never do. That part is yours.*\n\n*Push, or walk away. I hold no opinion. I am only the threshold.*\n\n*I keep what is kept. I open when opened.*\n\n*The draft grows stronger now, curling around my edges, carrying a scent you almost recognize.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":235,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}